  "_notes": "Starting list for BI / data-analyst postings, same schema as scripts/score/taxonomy/ai-engineering-skills.json. NOT exhaustive and NOT auto-updating. Deliberately excludes the bare words 'R' and 'excel' (the verb: 'you will excel at...') and matches Excel only in spreadsheet-like contexts, so Excel is probably UNDER-counted. Mentions are not requirements.",
